      "id": "s3",
      "concept": "Newton's Second Law",
      "narration": "When a force acts on an object, it accelerates in the direction of the force. The acceleration is directly proportional to the net force and inversely proportional to the mass. For example, pushing a shopping cart with twice the force doubles its acceleration if mass stays the same.",
